{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794836205952,"sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffewublFfeB69OFwG","part":{"partID":"prt_1e493103d0011lXa7CJdIwaXO6","sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffewublFfeB69OFwG","messageID":"msg_1e492edde0019tGrjR4sysPsQQ","type":"tool","id":"call_01_94lsve8dkte6kzy3mt69dagf","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -rn \"with-research\\|with-phases\\|with-context\" .skilled/commands --include=*.md | head -20"},"output":".skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md:3:argument-hint: \"<feature-description> [:auto|:confirm|:autopilot|:unattended|--unattended] [:with-research] [:with-context] [:with-phases]\"\n.skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md:33:2. Treat `:with-research`, `:with-context`, `:with-phases`, `--phases`, `--phase-names`, and `--phase-folder` as workflow inputs, not execution modes.\n.skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md:46:| `:with-research` | no value | Runs the research pass before planning. |\n.skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md:47:| `:with-context` | no value | Loads a context package before planning. |\n.skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md:48:| `:with-phases` | no value | Decomposes the packet into phase children and plans the first one. |\n.skilled/commands/speckit/plan.md:3:argument-hint: \"<feature-description> [:auto|:confirm|:autopilot|:unattended|--unattended] [:with-context] [:with-phases] [--level=N]\"\n.skilled/commands/speckit/plan.md:33:2. Treat `:with-context`, `:with-phases`, `--intake-only`, `--phases`, `--phase-names`, `--phase-folder`, `--spec-folder`, `--level`, `--start-state`, `--repair-mode`, and relationship flags as workflow inputs, not execution modes.\n.skilled/commands/speckit/plan.md:46:| `:with-context` | no value | Loads a context package before planning. |\n.skilled/commands/speckit/plan.md:47:| `:with-phases` | no value | Decomposes the packet into phase children and plans the first one. |\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":".skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md:3:argument-hint: \"<feature-description> [:auto|:confirm|:autopilot|:unattended|--unattended] [:with-research] [:with-context] [:with-phases]\"\n.skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md:33:2. Treat `:with-research`, `:with-context`, `:with-phases`, `--phases`, `--phase-names`, and `--phase-folder` as workflow inputs, not execution modes.\n.skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md:46:| `:with-research` | no value | Runs the research pass before planning. |\n.skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md:47:| `:with-context` | no value | Loads a context package before planning. |\n.skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md:48:| `:with-phases` | no value | Decomposes the packet into phase children and plans the first one. |\n.skilled/commands/speckit/plan.md:3:argument-hint: \"<feature-description> [:auto|:confirm|:autopilot|:unattended|--unattended] [:with-context] [:with-phases] [--level=N]\"\n.skilled/commands/speckit/plan.md:33:2. Treat `:with-context`, `:with-phases`, `--intake-only`, `--phases`, `--phase-names`, `--phase-folder`, `--spec-folder`, `--level`, `--start-state`, `--repair-mode`, and relationship flags as workflow inputs, not execution modes.\n.skilled/commands/speckit/plan.md:46:| `:with-context` | no value | Loads a context package before planning. |\n.skilled/commands/speckit/plan.md:47:| `:with-phases` | no value | Decomposes the packet into phase children and plans the first one. |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -rn \\\"with-research\\\\|with-phases\\\\|with-context\\\" .skilled/commands --include=*.md | head -20\"}"},"time":{"start":1794836205629,"end":1794836205952}}}}
