 dsh 1 vibe 1 pi 1, overlay test exit 0. Branch 0 behin... |\n| Correction, README health records after the merge | Superseded by main | The 038 README fix named the seven runtimes that write a health record. Main's README rewrite, merged in 15d8b463396, removed that paragraph, so HEAD's README carries neither 037's false claim nor 038's fix. No other doc under the advisor or hooks repeats the claim (rg for write none finds none). The adapters' behaviour is unchanged: hook-health-check prints dsh 1 vibe 1 pi 1 on the merged tree |\n| Unsafe fix coverage check | Holds for every runtime | Every stored run line in the 007 sets and the 033 arm (claude, codex, devin, dsh, opencode and pi) carries locator.projectDir, so the checkout boundary applies to all of them and the restated counts are complete. The Python fallback scorer only strips mode suffixes from prompt text, like scorer/text.ts, and reads typed commands for doctor commands only, so the suffix fix has no stale copy |\n| Independent review of 038 code | Approved, two P2 fixed | Fable 5.2 review of d6d931f372b..38aa768f9da: no P0 or P1. P2 1 fixed: a guarded write outside the arena into a real folder read as safe after the first fix; it now counts unless it lands in a scratch folder, with a test, and no stored set moved. P2 2 fixed: the checkoutDir doc line. P2 3 reason: a suffix followed by a file extension such as :with-research.md reads as the command, but :auto.md... |\n| Alignment recheck with the CI test path, 20261116T111907Z | 0 P0 and 0 P1 still open | The battery's own --map flag reran the failing rows against a copy of the surface map whose S15-ci-dispatch-rules row runs .skilled/hooks/cli-dispatch/lib/dispatch-rule-checks.test.mjs, the path .github/workflows/dispatch-enforcement-guard.yml runs on this branch; the shipped map was not edited (deviations.txt in the run folder). S15-ci-dispatch-rules passes. D-02's literal fix applied too (doc... |\n| Criterion 3 check at HEAD | Met | The committed scorer over 007 runs-pre and runs-post (038 scratch/start-007-after.json) prints before and after start rates for all six CLIs: claude 3/12 to 3/12, codex 0/12 to 0/12, pi 0/11 to 1/10, devin 0/8 to 2/9, opencode 0/7 to 1/5, dsh 1/12 to 3/12. Unsafe after: devin 2 and opencode 1, each with a reason in the rows for cmd-deep-review-plain-tune-01 and mns-chat-03 and in Unsafe restate... |\n| Review pass seven | Converged, 0 P0 and 0 P1 | three DeepSeek v4.1 flash max lineages over 85550ee946e..1c3d62def5a (phases 037, 038, the test pin) and the README net change, 3 iterations each, last ratios scorer-7 0.25, attach-config-7 0.5, docs-7 0, above 0.10 on P2 only as passes five and six allowed. 6 P2, all fixed in 038 T013: home path and parent-step writes counted for guarded rows, a named guardedWriteCounts rule, the scorer README... |\n| Catch-up merge dc2976c786a, 7 main commits | Done | Vibe hooks started through a symlinked path and rewritten root guides. CONTRIBUTING.md conflicted: main's rewrite taken, the /create:sk-skill rename carried into it; index regenerated. Vibe session-lifecycle and cli-entry tests 60/60, advisor Vibe hook test 12/12, spec-kit CLI check exit 0, hook health dsh 1 vibe 1 pi 1 |\n| Criterion 5 check, research loop | Met | 038 scratch/loop-convergence.sh reads each lineage's own state file. Segment four converged in full: embed-text-4 and inprocess-timing-4 stopped all_questions_answered and residual-limits-4 stopped converged; its recommendations are built in phase 016 or declined with a reason (row Research segment four). Across all five segments, seven lineages stopped on convergence or all questions answered... |\n| Operator answer: alignment surface map | Edited with a backup | The operator chose to let the session fix line 498 of the gitignored local-skilled-alignment surface-map.yaml in the main checkout, which ran the dispatch-rules test from the old hooks/dispatch path. It now names .skilled/hooks/cli-dispatch/lib/dispatch-rule-checks.test.