{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794836591741,"sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffewublFfeB69OFwG","part":{"partID":"prt_1e498f34a001aMsp1Rzf03DHmU","sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffewublFfeB69OFwG","messageID":"msg_1e498c973001d276v66WCt9VT5","type":"tool","id":"call_00_r8ls8u53oor7ko3il62mmj0d","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -n \"synthesis_complete\\|synthesis\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | head -20"},"output":"8:action: Run deep-review loop from initialization through synthesis\n323:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n325:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n540:          applies_when: \"legacy_migration_detected == true and the branch taken resumes the session or goes to synthesis; never on restart or cancel\"\n586:          log: \"Prior session already completed. Either archive the completed review/ tree and start a fresh session, or jump straight to synthesis with the existing artifacts.\"\n587:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n952:          log: \"Duration limit reached after {elapsed_minutes} minutes. Skipping dispatch and entering synthesis with partial findings.\"\n954:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n955:          note: \"The stop row is printed, not appended: the gateway refuses an event it has no ledger stem for. The reason reaches the synthesis report through the bound reason.\"\n1023:          1. if iteration_count >= max_iterations: STOP (maxIterationsReached). This terminal cap is evaluated before every veto, the claim-adjudication veto included; failed legal-stop gates are recorded in stop_decision.blockedBy as synthesis evidence.\n1024:          1a. After 3 consecutive failed iterations (status error or timeout), halt the loop and enter synthesis with stop reason error and partial findings.\n1122:            purpose: \"In confirm mode, ask the operator Retry / Skip / Cancel before synthesis starts.\"\n1129:              C) Cancel: end the run with no synthesis\n1138:            when: \"Run once, immediately before control jumps to phase_synthesis: in if_existing_terminal_path, in the divergent pivot's if_failed and on_error branches, and in every confirm-mode manualStop exit (on_C) into phase_synthesis: both divergent pivot gates, gate_pre_iteration and the post-iteration gate. The auto three-errors stop (reason error) reaches it through if_existing_terminal_path. The duration stop in step_check_max_duration runs it, once, before its jump to phase_synthesis. Never run it when the pivot continues the loop.\"\n1222:                action: \"Adopt a successful read-only review direction or fail closed to the existing synthesis path\"\n1244:                      C) manualStop and proceed to the existing pre-synthesis gate\n1257:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1282:                      A) Fail closed to synthesis\n1284:                      C) manualStop and proceed to the existing pre-synthesis gate\n1301:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"8:action: Run deep-review loop from initialization through synthesis\n323:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n325:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n540:          applies_when: \"legacy_migration_detected == true and the branch taken resumes the session or goes to synthesis; never on restart or cancel\"\n586:          log: \"Prior session already completed. Either archive the completed review/ tree and start a fresh session, or jump straight to synthesis with the existing artifacts.\"\n587:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n952:          log: \"Duration limit reached after {elapsed_minutes} minutes. Skipping dispatch and entering synthesis with partial findings.\"\n954:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n955:          note: \"The stop row is printed, not appended: the gateway refuses an event it has no ledger stem for. The reason reaches the synthesis report through the bound reason.\"\n1023:          1. if iteration_count >= max_iterations: STOP (maxIterationsReached). This terminal cap is evaluated before every veto, the claim-adjudication veto included; failed legal-stop gates are recorded in stop_decision.blockedBy as synthesis evidence.\n1024:          1a. After 3 consecutive failed iterations (status error or timeout), halt the loop and enter synthesis with stop reason error and partial findings.\n1122:            purpose: \"In confirm mode, ask the operator Retry / Skip / Cancel before synthesis starts.\"\n1129:              C) Cancel: end the run with no synthesis\n1138:            when: \"Run once, immediately before control jumps to phase_synthesis: in if_existing_terminal_path, in the divergent pivot's if_failed and on_error branches, and in every confirm-mode manualStop exit (on_C) into phase_synthesis: both divergent pivot gates, gate_pre_iteration and the post-iteration gate. The auto three-errors stop (reason error) reaches it through if_existing_terminal_path. The duration stop in step_check_max_duration runs it, once, before its jump to phase_synthesis. Never run it when the pivot continues the loop.\"\n1222:                action: \"Adopt a successful read-only review direction or fail closed to the existing synthesis path\"\n1244:                      C) manualStop and proceed to the existing pre-synthesis gate\n1257:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1282:                      A) Fail closed to synthesis\n1284:                      C) manualStop and proceed to the existing pre-synthesis gate\n1301:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -n \\\"synthesis_complete\\\\|synthesis\\\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | head -20\"}"},"time":{"start":1794836591434,"end":1794836591741}}}}
