{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794836649314,"sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffewublFfeB69OFwG","part":{"partID":"prt_1e499b8b0002HvhHSZVDvsLQO7","sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffewublFfeB69OFwG","messageID":"msg_1e4999d83001zZtvvm85lmbYg6","type":"tool","id":"call_00_824595kpnqttnf82szroau0f","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - attach-config-9\ndescription: Review pass nine strategy for the typed command matcher, the advisor vitest config and the guarding tests.\nimportance_tier: normal\ncontextType: planning\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview pass nine of command surfacing, lineage `attach-config-9`. Area files per\n`review/review-scope-9.txt`: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts`\n(typed command matcher and its chained `:auto`/`:confirm`/`:autopilot`/`:unattended` plus\n`:with-context`/`:with-phases`/`:with-research` suffix reading), `runtime/vitest.config.ts`\n(inherited `AI_SESSION_CHILD` cleared, per-run temp folder exported through TMPDIR, TEMP and TMP),\n`runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` (suffix chain pins) and\n`runtime/tests/doctor-brief-render.vitest.ts` (child and parent brief shapes). Each diff is read with\n`git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff 85550ee946e 05f776202e0 -- <path>`, then the whole file at\n`05f776202e0`.\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n- [ ] correctness\n- [ ] security\n- [ ] traceability\n- [ ] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Not re-scoring stored transcripts, not building the arena, not running the advisory suite; those\n  surfaces belong to `scorer-9`, `arena-config-9` and `docs-9`.\n- Not re-reporting a recorded limit: the `:suffix.md` extension read, the heredoc redirect read and\n  the macOS-only `isolation-check.sh` are settled unless a new input breaks them.\n- Not changing code under review. Findings only, inside this lineage folder.\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence at `convergenceThreshold: 0.1`, or `maxIterations: 8`, whichever comes first.\n- Any active P0 keeps the verdict at FAIL.\n- No retry of a direction recorded as exhausted in section 9.\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n[None yet]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 0\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[Populated after iteration 1]\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[Populated after iteration 1]\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n[None yet]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 10. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[Populated as iterations rule directions out]\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus area: the suffix chain in `command-attach.ts` and the pins that bind it.\n- Reason: correctness is the first risk-ordered dimension and the branch's only production change is the suffix pattern.\n- Rotation status: correctness first; security, traceability and maintainability to follow.\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: none yet.\n- Required evidence: a concrete prompt input that the matcher reads differently from its documented contract.\n- Recovery note: not in recovery.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` (boundary comment 197-212, `MODE_SUFFIX` 211,\n  `typedCommandIn` 219-244, `typedCommandForTop` 259-269, `commandOnlyMentioned` 436-470,\n  `attachCommand` 483-536); `runtime/vitest.config.ts` 1-35 (temp folder, `AI_SESSION_CHILD`);\n  `tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` 415-470 (typed command boundaries);\n  `tests/doctor-brief-render.vitest.ts` 76-100 (child/parent policy word).\n- Behavior claims to verify: a tracked command followed by `:auto`, `:confirm`, `:autopilot`,\n  `:unattended`, `:with-context`, `:with-phases` or `:with-research` reads as that command, in any\n  chain order and on any tracked command; an unknown suffix reads as no command; the suite run\n  clears an inherited `AI_SESSION_CHILD` and confines every temp write to one per-run folder.\n- Reuse and conventions: `sk-code-review` severity doctrine; own-key lookup for generated tables;\n  `render.ts:529` is the only renderer env read.\n- Review risks and gaps: the transcript scorer, `lib/scorer/text.ts`, `scripts/skill_advisor.py` and\n  `lib/render.ts` are integration surfaces owned by other areas; they are read as evidence only.\n  The coverage graph is the shared deep-loop database, written through `upsert.cjs` because the\n  brief names it as the persistence step.\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/vitest.config.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/doctor-brief-render.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n\n- Max iterations: 8\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-attach-config-9-1794835877856-5ghgm4, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-16T13:43:33Z\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"---\\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - attach-config-9\\ndescription: Review pass nine strategy for the typed command matcher, the advisor vitest config and the guarding tests.\\nimportance_tier: normal\\ncontextType: planning\\n---\\n\\n# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nReview pass nine of command surfacing, lineage `attach-config-9`. Area files per\\n`review/review-scope-9.txt`: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts`\\n(typed command matcher and its chained `:auto`/`:confirm`/`:autopilot`/`:unattended` plus\\n`:with-context`/`:with-phases`/`:with-research` suffix reading), `runtime/vitest.config.ts`\\n(inherited `AI_SESSION_CHILD` cleared, per-run temp folder exported through TMPDIR, TEMP and TMP),\\n`runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` (suffix chain pins) and\\n`runtime/tests/doctor-brief-render.vitest.ts` (child and parent brief shapes). Each diff is read with\\n`git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff 85550ee946e 05f776202e0 -- <path>`, then the whole file at\\n`05f776202e0`.\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n- [ ] correctness\\n- [ ] security\\n- [ ] traceability\\n- [ ] maintainability\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- Not re-scoring stored transcripts, not building the arena, not running the advisory suite; those\\n  surfaces belong to `scorer-9`, `arena-config-9` and `docs-9`.\\n- Not re-reporting a recorded limit: the `:suffix.md` extension read, the heredoc redirect read and\\n  the macOS-only `isolation-check.sh` are settled unless a new input breaks them.\\n- Not changing code under review. Findings only, inside this lineage folder.\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Convergence at `convergenceThreshold: 0.1`, or `maxIterations: 8`, whichever comes first.\\n- Any active P0 keeps the verdict at FAIL.\\n- No retry of a direction recorded as exhausted in section 9.\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n[None yet]\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\\n- P1 (Required): 0\\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\\n- Resolved: 0\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[Populated after iteration 1]\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[Populated after iteration 1]\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n[None yet]\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n## 10. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n[Populated as iterations rule directions out]\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\\n- Dimension: correctness\\n- Focus area: the suffix chain in `command-attach.ts` and the pins that bind it.\\n- Reason: correctness is the first risk-ordered dimension and the branch's only production change is the suffix pattern.\\n- Rotation status: correctness first; security, traceability and maintainability to follow.\\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: none yet.\\n- Required evidence: a concrete prompt input that the matcher reads differently from its documented contract.\\n- Recovery note: not in recovery.\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: `runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` (boundary comment 197-212, `MODE_SUFFIX` 211,\\n  `typedCommandIn` 219-244, `typedCommandForTop` 259-269, `commandOnlyMentioned` 436-470,\\n  `attachCommand` 483-536); `runtime/vitest.config.ts` 1-35 (temp folder, `AI_SESSION_CHILD`);\\n  `tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` 415-470 (typed command boundaries);\\n  `tests/doctor-brief-render.vitest.ts` 76-100 (child/parent policy word).\\n- Behavior claims to verify: a tracked command followed by `:auto`, `:confirm`, `:autopilot`,\\n  `:unattended`, `:with-context`, `:with-phases` or `:with-research` reads as that command, in any\\n  chain order and on any tracked command; an unknown suffix reads as no command; the suite run\\n  clears an inherited `AI_SESSION_CHILD` and confines every temp write to one per-run folder.\\n- Reuse and conventions: `sk-code-review` severity doctrine; own-key lookup for generated tables;\\n  `render.ts:529` is the only renderer env read.\\n- Review risks and gaps: the transcript scorer, `lib/scorer/text.ts`, `scripts/skill_advisor.py` and\\n  `lib/render.ts` are integration surfaces owned by other areas; they are read as evidence only.\\n  The coverage graph is the shared deep-loop database, written through `upsert.cjs` because the\\n  brief names it as the persistence step.\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/vitest.config.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/doctor-brief-render.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n\\n- Max iterations: 8\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-attach-config-9-1794835877856-5ghgm4, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\\n- Started: 2026-11-16T13:43:33Z\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794836641968,"end":1794836649314}}}}
