{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794836703263,"sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffewublFfeB69OFwG","part":{"partID":"prt_1e49a9e030010kiV5uGT0Nk8Ba","sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffewublFfeB69OFwG","messageID":"msg_1e49a9407001E5sIXmIayzz3TD","type":"tool","id":"call_00_abl4n468v7io70zgtx3obrs2","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n- Importing the area source directly with node's type stripping and calling `typedCommandIn`, `commandOnlyMentioned`, `typedCommandForTop` and `attachCommand` on a probe matrix. The module imports nothing, so the probe exercised the reviewed code itself rather than a transcription, and it settled the chain, the boundaries, the refusal leads and the deep-loop gate in one pass. (iteration 1)\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- Nothing failed. The advisor suite was deliberately not run: the lineage write surface forbids the cache and fixture writes a suite run makes, and the changed behaviour is pure string matching that a direct call proves. (iteration 1)","oldString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[Populated after iteration 1]\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[Populated after iteration 1]","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -54,13 +54,13 @@\n \n <!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n ## 8. WHAT WORKED\n \n-[Populated after iteration 1]\n+- Importing the area source directly with node's type stripping and calling `typedCommandIn`, `commandOnlyMentioned`, `typedCommandForTop` and `attachCommand` on a probe matrix. The module imports nothing, so the probe exercised the reviewed code itself rather than a transcription, and it settled the chain, the boundaries, the refusal leads and the deep-loop gate in one pass. (iteration 1)\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n \n-[Populated after iteration 1]\n+- Nothing failed. The advisor suite was deliberately not run: the lineage write surface forbids the cache and fixture writes a suite run makes, and the changed behaviour is pure string matching that a direct call proves. (iteration 1)\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n ## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n [None yet]\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n- Importing the area source directly with node's type stripping and calling `typedCommandIn`, `commandOnlyMentioned`, `typedCommandForTop` and `attachCommand` on a probe matrix. The module imports nothing, so the probe exercised the reviewed code itself rather than a transcription, and it settled the chain, the boundaries, the refusal leads and the deep-loop gate in one pass. (iteration 1)\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n- Nothing failed. The advisor suite was deliberately not run: the lineage write surface forbids the cache and fixture writes a suite run makes, and the changed beh