{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794836703268,"sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffewublFfeB69OFwG","part":{"partID":"prt_1e49aa29c001t3RSKdhz3nNFGW","sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffewublFfeB69OFwG","messageID":"msg_1e49a9407001E5sIXmIayzz3TD","type":"tool","id":"call_01_n6witxz7xpka74zb8peew04p","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: security\n- Focus area: `vitest.config.ts` as a trust boundary (temp folder mode, three-variable export, exit cleanup, cleared `AI_SESSION_CHILD`) and the tests that pin child or parent shapes.\n- Reason: correctness is clean; the config change touches process-wide environment and a temp folder, which is the security review of this area.\n- Rotation status: correctness complete; security next, then traceability and maintainability.\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: source-imported probes are productive; nothing blocked.\n- Required evidence: an environment state where the per-run isolation or the flag clearing does not hold.\n- Recovery note: not in recovery.","oldString":"## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus area: the suffix chain in `command-attach.ts` and the pins that bind it.\n- Reason: correctness is the first risk-ordered dimension and the branch's only production change is the suffix pattern.\n- Rotation status: correctness first; security, traceability and maintainability to follow.\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: none yet.\n- Required evidence: a concrete prompt input that the matcher reads differently from its documented contract.\n- Recovery note: not in recovery.","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-