{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794836800480,"sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffewublFfeB69OFwG","part":{"partID":"prt_1e49c2189001sKalObNJpt0Xby","sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffewublFfeB69OFwG","messageID":"msg_1e49c1827001OdVzOYvuuqIWzK","type":"tool","id":"call_00_mqv4e0v1jvqrn6d3zfmgiv58","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && sed -n '25,70p' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md; echo '=== next focus'; grep -n \"ANCHOR:next-focus\" -A 14 specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md | head -20"},"output":"- [ ] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Not re-scoring stored transcripts, not building the arena, not running the advisory suite; those\n  surfaces belong to `scorer-9`, `arena-config-9` and `docs-9`.\n- Not re-reporting a recorded limit: the `:suffix.md` extension read, the heredoc redirect read and\n  the macOS-only `isolation-check.sh` are settled unless a new input breaks them.\n- Not changing code under review. Findings only, inside this lineage folder.\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence at `convergenceThreshold: 0.1`, or `maxIterations: 8`, whichever comes first.\n- Any active P0 keeps the verdict at FAIL.\n- No retry of a direction recorded as exhausted in section 9.\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n- [x] correctness\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 0\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n- Importing the area source directly with node's type stripping and calling `typedCommandIn`, `commandOnlyMentioned`, `typedCommandForTop` and `attachCommand` on a probe matrix. The module imports nothing, so the probe exercised the reviewed code itself rather than a transcription, and it settled the chain, the boundaries, the refusal leads and the deep-loop gate in one pass. (iteration 1)\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- Nothing failed. The advisor suite was deliberately not run: the lineage write surface forbids the cache and fixture writes a suite run makes, and the changed behaviour is pure string matching that a direct call proves. (iteration 1)\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n### A false `:auto` match inside `:automation`: re-checked; the trailing lookahead rejects the following letter and the chain cannot back down to zero repetitions. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:211] -- BLOCKED (iteration 1, 1 attempts)\n- What was tried: A false `:auto` match inside `:automation`: re-checked; the trailing lookahead rejects the following letter and the chain cannot back down to zero repetitions. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:211]\n- Why blocked: Repeated iteration evidence ruled this direction out.\n- Do NOT retry: A false `:auto` match inside `:automation`: re-checked; the trailing lookahead rejects the following letter and the chain cannot back down to zero repetitions. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:211]\n\n### A second environment dependency in the brief renderer that the test config forgets: `render.ts` reads only `AI_SESSION_CHILD`, and the config clears exactly that name. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:529] -- BLOCKED (iteration 1, 1 attempts)\n=== next focus\n103:<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n104-## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n105-- Dimension: security - Focus area: `vitest.config.ts` as a trust boundary (temp folder creation, export and cleanup, the cleared child flag) plus the test files that pin child/parent shapes. - Reason: correctness produced no finding; security is the next risk-ordered dimension and the config change touches process-wide environment and a temp folder. - Rotation status: correctness complete; security next, then traceability and maintainability. - Blocked/productive carry-forward: direct read plus source-imported probes stayed productive; nothing blocked. - Required evidence: an input or environment state under which the suite's temp isolation or child-flag clearing fails to hold. - Recovery note: not in recovery. Review verdict: PASS\n106-\n107:<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n108-## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n109-\n110-### Bounded Context Snapshot\n111-\n112-- Target pointers: `runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` (boundary comment 197-212, `MODE_SUFFIX` 211,\n113-  `typedCommandIn` 219-244, `typedCommandForTop` 259-269, `commandOnlyMentioned` 436-470,\n114-  `attachCommand` 483-536); `runtime/vitest.config.ts` 1-35 (temp folder, `AI_SESSION_CHILD`);\n115-  `tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` 415-470 (typed command boundaries);\n116-  `tests/doctor-brief-render.vitest.ts` 76-100 (child/parent policy word).\n117-- Behavior claims to verify: a tracked command followed by `:auto`, `:confirm`, `:autopilot`,\n118-  `:unattended`, `:with-context`, `:with-phases` or `:with-research` reads as that command, in any\n119-  chain order and on any tracked command; an unknown suffix reads as no command; the suite run\n120-  clears an inherited `AI_SESSION_CHILD` and confines every temp write to one per-run folder.\n121-- Reuse and conventions: `sk-code-review` severity doctrine; own-key lookup for generated tables;\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- [ ] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Not re-scoring stored transcripts, not building the arena, not running the advisory suite; those\n  surfaces belong to `scorer-9`, `arena-config-9` and `docs-9`.