{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794837043307,"sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffewublFfeB69OFwG","part":{"partID":"prt_1e49fc902001jTJssFEvgJLQzX","sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffewublFfeB69OFwG","messageID":"msg_1e49fbe1a001blM5xTU2dmaHN1","type":"tool","id":"call_00_ez954gi8npe24r2b0yw0p9ri","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Comparing the source pattern against an unanchored variant on the suite's own negative inputs. That separated a property the tests actually prove from one they only appear to prove, which is how the single P2 in this pass was found instead of assumed away. (iteration 3)\n- Rebuilding the state picture from the files instead of from memory: registry, state log, deltas and narrative were each read back and compared. It caught a reducer-derived dimension mislabel, which a narrative-only check would have left standing. (iteration 4)","oldString":"- Comparing the source pattern against an unanchored variant on the suite's own negative inputs. That separated a property the tests actually prove from one they only appear to prove, which is how the single P2 in this pass was found instead of assumed away. (iteration 3)","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -58,8 +58,9 @@\n \n - Importing the area source directly with node's type stripping and calling `typedCommandIn`, `commandOnlyMentioned`, `typedCommandForTop` and `attachCommand` on a probe matrix. The module imports nothing, so the probe exercised the reviewed code itself rather than a transcription, and it settled the chain, the boundaries, the refusal leads and the deep-loop gate in one pass. (iteration 1)\n - Sweeping every `AI_SESSION_CHILD` reference under the advisor runtime (8 files, 22 matches) instead of judging the config line alone. It proved that each test which needs the child shape injects the flag, so a process-wide clear cannot weaken a boundary assertion. (iteration 2)\n - Comparing the source pattern against an unanchored variant on the suite's own negative inputs. That separated a property the tests actually prove from one they only appear to prove, which is how the single P2 in this pass was found instead of assumed away. (iteration 3)\n+- Rebuilding the state picture from the files instead of from memory: registry, state log, deltas and narrative were each read back and compared. It caught a reducer-derived dimension mislabel, which a narrative-only check would have left standing. (iteration 4)\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n \n - Nothing failed. The advisor suite was deliberately not run: the lineage write surface forbids the cache and fixture writes a suite run makes, and the changed behaviour is pure string matching that a direct call proves. (iteration 1)\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"- Comparing the source pattern against an unanchored variant on the suite's own negative inputs. That separated a property the tests actually prove from one they only appear to prove, which is how the single P2 in this pass was found instead of assumed away. (iteration 3)\\n- Rebuilding the state picture from the files instead of from memory: registry, state log, deltas and narrative were each read back and compared. It caught a reducer-derived dimension mislabel, which a narrative-only check would have left standing. (iteration 4)\", \"oldString\": \"- Comparing the source pattern against an unanchored variant on the suite's own negative inputs. That separated a property the tests actually prove from one they only appear to prove, which is how the single P2 in this pass was found instead of assumed away. (iteration 3)\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-9/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794837039362,"end":1794837043307}}}}
